/// `thunk_expression`: a thunk: a suspended computation at the unrestricted grade, written with its glyph and in ASCII.
/// The checker does not reach this form yet.
///
/// - owes: #1112
@[ refuses("OutOfFragment.grade.value") ]
def later = thunk[ω] { return 42 } ;
@[ refuses("OutOfFragment.grade.value") ]
def laterAscii = thunk[inf] { return 42 } ;
